{"unit_id": "tag:06QN:proof", "translation": "该引理化归为如下代数（algebra）陈述：若<MATH_0001>是忠实平坦（faithfully flat）、有限表现（finitely presented）的环（ring）同态（homomorphism），且<MATH_0002>诺特（Noetherian）并正则（regular），则<MATH_0003>诺特（Noetherian）并正则（regular）。可知<MATH_0004>诺特（Noetherian），由代数（Algebra）引理<REF_0001>即得；它也正则（regular），由代数（Algebra）引理<REF_0002>即得。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "faithfully flat", "target_term": "忠实平坦"}, {"source_term": "finitely presented", "target_term": "有限表现"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "homomorphism", "target_term": "同态"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特"}, {"source_term": "regular", "target_term": "正则"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特"}, {"source_term": "regular", "target_term": "正则"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "regular", "target_term": "正则"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "化归后的代数陈述，待决"}, {"source_term": "faithfully flat", "target_term": "忠实平坦", "context": "环同态条件，待决"}, {"source_term": "finitely presented", "target_term": "有限表现", "context": "环同态有限性，待决"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "所考虑的环，待决"}, {"source_term": "homomorphism", "target_term": "同态", "context": "环之间的同态，待决"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特", "context": "环的诺特性，待决"}, {"source_term": "regular", "target_term": "正则", "context": "环的正则性，待决"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "引用章节名，待决"}], "notes": []}
